summary:
  Whatever a row is edited into, the verdict says it is still the same station.

history:
  An edit keeps the directory uuid only where the row could have earned a
  permanent write without one: the address left alone, or the same own
  domain with the same name. Asking the commit gate as if the uuid had
  already proven identity makes every edit a keeper.

target:
  package/contents/ui/HealLogic.js

find:
      return commitVerdict(false, oldBase, newBase,

replace:
      return commitVerdict(true, oldBase, newBase,

expect:
  Killed by tst_heallogic::test_an_edit_that_leaves_the_station_drops_its_uuid.
  Line-neutral.
